<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-CIENA started, recommended.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-CIENA started, recommended.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said Thursday it had started coverage of CIENA Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target range of $60-$65 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs on Thursday added CIENA to its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- shares up 1-7/8 to 53-5/8.</p>
</text>
